","codes":["2.01","7.01","8.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Completed an acquisition or disposal","kind":"deal","tone":"blue"},{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"},{"label":"Other material event","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000119312526022582/0001193125-26-022582-index.htm"},{"date":"2026-01-12","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","7.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"},{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000175942526000004/0001759425-26-000004-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-12-19","form":"8-K","codes":["8.01"],"events":[{"label":"Other material event","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000119312525326822/0001193125-25-326822-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-12-19","form":"8-K","codes":["1.01","3.02","7.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Material agreement entered","kind":"deal","tone":"good"},{"label":"Unregistered sale of equity","kind":"finance","tone":"warn"},{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000119312525325825/0001193125-25-325825-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[{"date":"2019-08-01","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000119312519210092/0001193125-19-210092-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2019-07-30","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000107261319000249/0001072613-19-000249-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2019-07-26","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000119312519204056/0001193125-19-204056-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2019-07-23","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000119312519200063/0001193125-19-200063-index.htm","tone":"warn"}],"summary":{"sentences":["Mirum Pharmaceuticals, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Pharmaceutical Preparations\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 6 years.","It reported $532.3m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 43.3% against the same quarter a year earlier.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 20 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 43.3% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $159.9m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000175942526000037/0001759425-26-000037-index.htm","accession":"0001759425-26-000037"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000175942526000037/0001759425-26-000037-index.htm","accession":"0001759425-26-000037"},{"text":"Net cash of $386.3m against total assets of $890.9m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000175942526000037/0001759425-26-000037-index.htm","accession":"0001759425-26-000037"}],"bear":[{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 36.5% across 8 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000175942526000037/0001759425-26-000037-index.htm","accession":"0001759425-26-000037"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-493.8% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000175942526000037/0001759425-26-000037-index.htm","accession":"0001759425-26-000037"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $774.3m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000175942526000037/0001759425-26-000037-index.htm","accession":"0001759425-26-000037"},{"text":"About 20 months of cash at the current burn ($386.3m against $234.3m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000175942526000037/0001759425-26-000037-index.htm","accession":"0001759425-26-000037"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 20.4% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000175942526000037/0001759425-26-000037-index.htm","accession":"0001759425-26-000037"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 10.6% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (35,315 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000161474026000011/0001614740-26-000011-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.5% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1759425/000161474026000011/0001614740-26-000011-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 22.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.22,"consecutive":2,"current":0.433,"current_display":"43.3%","threshold_display":"22.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"runway_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Cash runway falls below 12 months","metric":"runway_months","comparison":"below","threshold":12.0,"consecutive":1,"current":19.784,"current_display":"20 months","threshold_display":"12 months","fired":false,"rationale":"Below twelve months the company raises on whatever terms it can get, and that dilution lands on you.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 27.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.27,"consecutive":1,"current":0.204,"current_display":"20.4%","threshold_display":"27.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Share count growth above this rate transfers your stake to new holders faster than the business is likely to compound.","editable":true},{"id":"leverage_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Debt to equity rises above 1.00","metric":"debt_to_equity","comparison":"above","threshold":1.0,"consecutive":1,"current":0.0,"current_display":"0.00","threshold_display":"1.00","fired":false,"rationale":"Past this point creditors, not shareholders, decide what happens next.","editable":true},{"id":"going_concern","kind":"event","label":"Going-concern doubt appears in any filing","metric":"going_concern","comparison":"is_true","threshold":true,"current":false,"current_display":"not present","fired":false,"rationale":"The auditors saying the company may not survive the year is not a signal to interpret. It is the exit.","editable":false}],"team":[{"raw_name":"Peetz Christopher","role":"Officer","title_filed":"CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER","shares":194309.0,"sold_in_window":20000.0,"bought_in_window":0.0,"last_filing":"2026-07-08","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001759425","confidence":"filed","p